        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "SECTION 8.3. The employee who is the successful candidate shall be notified of his/her selection. The Business Manager shall also be notified of the name of the successful candidate within fourteen (14) days of the selection. The successful candidate shall be notified of his/her release date within fourteen (14) calendar days of being awarded the job. Any increase in compensation shall be effective the first pay period following the acceptance of the job. Reasonable effort will be made to release the employee as expediently as the business allows.",
